The far side of the hairline fracture under [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Teller's Run/index|Teller's Run]] is open grassland under clean, unpolluted air, the shape of the land around [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]] with no city built on it. Mountains stand to the north and a wide river runs to the south. The fracture opens in the air above a metal grating platform raised a foot off the ground on pylons, framed by two pillars of running blue liquid.

Two miles off, a [[Divinity/Ashen Pact/Giant|Giant]] stands in the river with its feet in the water and its shoulders above the cloud line. It does not move.

Three buildings sit near the platform, stacked from corrugated shipping containers and lit by temporary lights. One is a bunkhouse, four bunk beds and a little storage, its fabrics singed black and its walls carrying an ashy smell. The second is packed with glass vats of the same glowing blue liquid the sewers pump, wound about with tubes and machinery that prints on reels of paper. The third holds a single tape mainframe the size of a room, the kind [[Org/Belvedere/index|Belvedere]] keeps, fed by cables run from the second building. Workers in rubberized suits keep to the machines. The compound is the working site of the [[Org/Embercall Industries/index|Embercall]]'s research.
